・販売等は致しません)。\n\n〇参考画像： Ｘアカウントとgoogle driveを記載いたします。\n①https://x.com/RyosukeTsukiyo\n②https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19_zo9HFwtI_E9Ew6ID3ziu95biPTWZ9d?usp=sharing\n\nもしもご縁がありましたら、どうぞよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 821164, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "空犬/sorainu🪁", "screen_name": "sorainu1211EAKA", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1907088509024059392/PBfH-Kea.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/940077227013693440/1768558852/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 899508, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "よしお", "screen_name": "scomsio", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F1643ff31-9fe7-49c5-a8d6-74e745d202d0.png%3Fsensitive%3Dtrue?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/a2332b22-d895-43ee-8c7f-713a5d903a09.png", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": 74, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 14, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 177}, {"id": 2620286, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "いかわさ🦑(チゲ味)", "screen_name": "Midori_annte23", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772462509385269248/3WO5dS3i.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1288136668696809473/1711452276/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "del